WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:06.288
Hi! Today we go into town.

2
00:00:06.688 --> 00:00:12.744
And you learn the dative. Don't worry, it's easy!

3
00:00:14.433 --> 00:00:17.297
What is there in town?

4
00:00:17.697 --> 00:00:19.985
the station

5
00:00:20.385 --> 00:00:22.457
the bank

6
00:00:22.857 --> 00:00:24.929
the post office

7
00:00:25.329 --> 00:00:27.545
the bakery

8
00:00:27.945 --> 00:00:30.233
the cinema

9
00:00:30.633 --> 00:00:32.705
the park

10
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:40.672
Where are you? After in, an, neben and bei comes the dative:

11
00:00:41.072 --> 00:00:44.416
der becomes dem: in the park.

12
00:00:44.816 --> 00:00:47.968
die becomes der: in the bank.

13
00:00:48.368 --> 00:00:51.808
das becomes dem: in the cinema.

14
00:00:52.208 --> 00:00:55.264
And in the plural: den.

15
00:00:56.967 --> 00:01:01.607
We speak fast. In dem becomes im:

16
00:01:02.007 --> 00:01:04.367
I'm in the park.

17
00:01:04.767 --> 00:01:07.271
And an dem becomes am:

18
00:01:07.671 --> 00:01:10.343
I'm waiting at the station.

19
00:01:10.743 --> 00:01:16.487
The same: bei dem becomes beim. I'm at the doctor's.

20
00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:22.936
Listen: Lena and Mateo are on the phone.

21
00:01:23.336 --> 00:01:27.352
Hi Lena! Where are you?

22
00:01:27.752 --> 00:01:30.448
I'm at the bakery.

23
00:01:30.848 --> 00:01:33.256
I'm waiting in the park.

24
00:01:33.656 --> 00:01:36.136
Next to the cinema?

25
00:01:36.536 --> 00:01:38.944
Yes, exactly!

26
00:01:39.344 --> 00:01:42.400
I'll be there in five minutes.

27
00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:53.588
Now you! Where are you now? And where do you like to be? Say it with im, am or in der.

28
00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:07.436
Great! Now you can:

29
00:02:07.836 --> 00:02:13.340
You know places in town and say where you are with the dative.

30
00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:15.860
See you soon!
